{"nodes":[{"id":"core","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":420,"height":220,"text":"# 十元发散引擎\n\n不是十元分类器，也不是仓库抽卡器。\n\n核心：任意对象/问题 → 锁定问题 → 找变量 → 单十元深发散 → 十元横向扫描 → 多十元组合 → 验证收束 → 创作输出"},{"id":"rule","type":"text","x":0,"y":-330,"width":420,"height":240,"text":"## Canvas 权限\n- 这是可视化工作台，不是理论正本\n- current canonical 永远高于 Canvas\n- 不得由职业/身份/情绪/颜色/题材/单名词倒推十元\n- mapping 只作案例、证据、边界校验与具象参考\n- 自动任务只镜像真实进展，不制造假节点"},{"id":"input","type":"text","x":-900,"y":20,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 入口\n任意对象 / 题材 / 故事 / 创作卡点 / 问题\n\n例：\n“一个想成为偶像的少女”\n“这个故事太普通”\n“这个关系没有戏”"},{"id":"lock_problem","type":"text","x":-520,"y":20,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 1｜锁定问题\n先问：到底哪里有问题？\n\n身份 / 目标 / 路径 / 关系 / 冲突 / 代价 / 结局 / 机制……\n\n不急着调用十元。"},{"id":"find_variable","type":"text","x":-520,"y":280,"width":300,"height":190,"text":"## 2｜变量发现\n把“普通/没戏/卡住”改写成可改变变量。\n\n输出：\n- object_layer\n- current state\n- changed_variable candidate\n- 可观测结果"},{"id":"single_deep","type":"text","x":560,"y":-180,"width":360,"height":230,"text":"# A｜单十元深发散\n一个十元自己长树。\n\n每元至少维护：\n1. 核心变量\n2. 发现问题\n3. 母级变换动作\n4. 子级分叉问题\n5. 继续发散规则\n6. 停止条件\n7. 邻居排除\n8. 反例\n9. 可组合接口"},{"id":"horizontal","type":"text","x":560,"y":120,"width":360,"height":190,"text":"# B｜十元横向扫描\n同一个问题同时交给十个十元寻找不同变量。\n\n目标不是判断“它属于谁”，而是发现：\n同一对象还能从哪些结构方向被改写？"},{"id":"combine","type":"text","x":560,"y":380,"width":360,"height":280,"text":"# C｜双/三十元交叉\n把已经独立成立的分支重新组合。\n\n必须保留各自 responsibility / relation_source。\n禁止 percent / weight / ratio。\n组合要产生新结构，不是把两个标签粘一起。\n\n硬门1：same characters / same window / same broad relation label 都不够，必须核对 same object + same changed_variable。\n硬门2：即便 same actor + same window + same object + same changed_variable 全满足，也必须让每个十元先独立过门；same-layer 不等于自动共现。"},{"id":"verify","type":"text","x":560,"y":690,"width":360,"height":400,"text":"# D｜验证与收束\n- nearest neighbor\n- removal test\n- reverse test\n- counterexample\n- same-object-layer / changed-variable gate\n- same-layer 之后仍要各十元独立过门\n- xz：option count reduction / two-terminal polarization ≠ single-terminal convergence\n- xz：same-variable 单接口减少 2→1 仍 ≠ current xz；须审 complete relevant path-set、持续收窄、汇流与临界逼近\n- endpoint attribution / competing-purpose anchor\n- ordinary self-agency ≠ x\n- protection success ≠ subject-specific protected-range x\n- 是否只是题材/名词换皮\n- 是否真正改变结构\n- 是否能继续长树\n\n收束成少量高价值方案。"},{"id":"outputs","type":"text","x":1040,"y":380,"width":320,"height":220,"text":"## 应用输出\n十元发散引擎不是只服务角色。\n\n可落地为：\n角色 / 故事 / 题材 / 世界观 / 关系 / 场景 / 游戏机制 / 镜头 / 创作卡点解决"},{"id":"zx","type":"text","x":-980,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### zx｜方向权发散\n发现：哪里存在最终方向由主体生成、夺取、扩大或公开反推？\n\n待扩：母变换动作 / 子分叉 / 纯 zx 边界"},{"id":"nx","type":"text","x":-640,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### nx｜外置通道发散\n发现：哪里已有外部方向、权限或通道，主体如何接入、续接、借力？\n\n待扩：任务 / 权限 / 位置 / 网络 / 改题权"},{"id":"zn","type":"text","x":-300,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### zn｜原则未来调用发散\n发现：什么在身份、收益、环境改变后，仍有资格进入未来判断？\n\n待扩：跨阶段 / 修订 / 利益冲突 / 身份变化"},{"id":"x","type":"text","x":40,"y":930,"width":300,"height":280,"text":"### x｜处置权发散\n发现：什么对象/资源真正归谁处置？\n\n当前发散候选维度需按正本边界校验：scope / permission / revocability / final decision / execution。\n\n已新增：scope/path-set 候选 + protected-range topology/window 动态分支。\n新增 strict-v2 护栏：保护结果成功 ≠ subject-specific protected-range x；ordinary self-agency ≠ x；独立用途/排序 anchor 可阻断 strict zn↔x。\n\n均不自动升级 canonical。"},{"id":"n","type":"text","x":-980,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### n｜内部承载发散\n发现：什么进入之后，被内部真实、持续地承载？\n\n待扩：准入 / 负荷 / 压力 / 重复进入 / 异质协调"},{"id":"x_parallel_z","type":"text","x":-640,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### x并z｜对外接口发散\n发现：什么内部结构形成稳定公共壳/对外接口？\n\n待按 current canonical 继续建立发散操作，禁止靠“公开感”倒推。"},{"id":"xn","type":"text","x":-300,"y":930,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### xn｜运行组织发散\n发现：什么运行过程正在组织时间、流程、阶段与执行？\n\n待扩：流程重组 / 节点 / 时序 / 调度 / 执行结构"},{"id":"z","type":"text","x":40,"y":650,"width":300,"height":180,"text":"### z｜确认发散\n发现：什么对象被谁明确看见、回应、确认和采用？\n\n当前应用映射仍有 pending-review 债务，Canvas 不替 canonical 裁决。"},{"id":"xz","type":"text","x":380,"y":930,"width":300,"height":340,"text":"### xz｜未来关闭发散\n发现：哪些未来回头路正在关闭？\n\n母分支示例：\n时间窗口 / 资格窗口 / 路径减少 / 代价上升 / 单次选择锁死 / 信息错位 / 外部封路 / 历史选择反噬。\n\n护栏1：选项数量变少、二极化、战争升级、最后只兑现一个结局，都不自动等于 xz；必须有前置终点持续取得支配地位，并让不同现实路径发生持续汇流。\n护栏2：同一 return_path_set 里一个接口真实关闭、路径数 2→1，仍不自动等于 current xz；必须看 complete relevant path-set 是否继续收窄并逼近 0/同一终点。"},{"id":"nz","type":"text","x":720,"y":930,"width":300,"height":300,"text":"### nz｜回返修复发散\n发现：哪些对象特异关系/位置，在离开或受损后仍保留真实回返、修复、重新接近路径？\n\n已出现可执行母分支：冲突修复型 nz。\n新增可迁移子型：political/legal reentry。失败接口、征讨压力或阶段性断开不自动归零 nz；若对象特异通道仍被现实反复调用、对方现实回应并最终完成重新进入，nz 可独立成立。\n核心不是“舍不得”，而是关系在断开后仍保有现实可调用的 reentry + repair。"},{"id":"automation_protocol","type":"text","x":1510,"y":-220,"width":430,"height":330,"text":"# 自动任务 → Canvas 镜像协议\n每次自动任务只有出现真实进展才扩展 Canvas。\n\n每轮可视节点至少记录：\n- 任务名 / 时间\n- 本轮真正解决的问题\n- 新发现变量\n- 新增/修正的发散分支\n- 组合或验证结果\n- rejected / nearest-neighbor 结论\n- 实际修改文件\n- commit SHA\n- 下一断点\n\n禁止只写“继续推进”。无真实变化不制造进展节点。"},{"id":"runlog","type":"text","x":1510,"y":200,"width":430,"height":300,"text":"# 自动任务运行轨迹区\n\n当前方向切换：\n“生成器/映射抽卡”降为应用层；研发中心改为“十元变量发现 + 单十元深发散 + 横向扫描 + 多元组合 + 验证收束”。\n\n起始 main：912499679248faedba74762cbe8692a85f836546\n最新已镜像源：01c9a0bbd295f31a0918e1cdee24fadda4595033"},{"id":"assets","type":"text","x":1040,"y":690,"width":320,"height":330,"text":"## 现有资产的新位置\ncanonical = 边界\nevidence = 成立证据\nmapping = 案例/参考/校验\n64题材库 = 落地空间\n角色生成器 = 一个应用端\nCanvas = 研发可视化镜像\n\n应用端硬门：trigger registry 与 compiler token/version 必须一致，否则 fail closed。\n新增：resolved_request 的 locked/reroll modules 必须归一、去重、固定顺序，语义等价请求应复现同一 provenance。\n新增输入边界：主体前连续“的”统一归一化；该修复不得改变 canonical token，尤其 x并z 必须保持原子化。"},{"id":"x_scope_pending_20260905","type":"text","x":380,"y":1210,"width":460,"height":430,"text":"## x｜scope / path-set 发散候选（L4 pending-review）\n来源：63883d7a7b648a63292ac054405021d8783eb3b1\n状态：pending-review，禁止覆盖 canonical\n\nchanged_variable 候选：object/object layer、permission_type、scope、term/revocability/return obligation、final decision/execution topology、override/veto/co-decision、actor-indexed path-set、actuator/target-effect layer、surviving path count、scope/permission transition。\n\n护栏：窄 scope 成立 ≠ 宽 scope 自动成立；宽 scope 不成立 ≠ 窄 current x 自动为假；same actor + same higher-level target effect ≠ same x execution-object path set。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1632_xscope","type":"text","x":1510,"y":570,"width":520,"height":390,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜x-scope pending-review 镜像\n来源 commit：63883d7a7b648a63292ac054405021d8783eb3b1\n解决：把 x scope/path-set 研究转译为单十元 x 可发散变量，保持 pending-review。\n新变量：object layer / permission type / scope / term / revocability / decision topology / execution path-set / transition。\n拒绝：formal authority、单次 compliance、接口持有、ownership 标签直接升级完整 x。\n下一断点：其它单十元可执行发散语法；等待 canonical 裁决。"},{"id":"nz_conflict_repair_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":1210,"width":500,"height":500,"text":"## nz｜冲突修复型回返发散（L4 evidence-locked candidate）\n来源：82985fccb036d425435961e9c50b4d6890664169\n案例：红楼梦 宝玉↔黛玉，第二十九→三十回\n权限：L4 may_override_canonical=false\n\nchanged_variable：对象特异关系 → 冲突/断开 → 现实重入请求 → 对方仍保留接纳资格 → 双方回应 → 修复并恢复共同接近。\n\n母分支：断开强度 / 重入资格 / 发起拓扑 / 修复深度 / 自由性 / 第三方依赖。\n护栏：感情深 / 舍不得 / 哭得厉害 / 命中注定 ≠ nz；关键是对象特异 + bilateral reentry + repair。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1832_nzrepair","type":"text","x":1510,"y":1020,"width":560,"height":500,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜nz 冲突修复型发散镜像\n检查范围：63883d7… → 82985fc…\n来源：c779776… 火轴总纲同步（无新机制）；82985fcc… 宝黛冲突修复 pure-nz positive control。\n新变量：relation-specific reentry eligibility / repair capacity / bilateral response / repair depth / third-factor dependence。\n新增：nz → conflict-repair-and-real-reentry。\n验证：nearest-neighbor 分账 z/x/n/nx；removal/reverse。\n下一断点：same window + same object layer 的 xz/nz 共现；其它单十元母分支。"},{"id":"generator_contract_20260905","type":"text","x":1040,"y":980,"width":440,"height":390,"text":"## 应用层｜trigger registry ↔ compiler 契约硬门\n来源：770fafb8725fc49f72e9f5308a93485c6c208360 + d354f9da292884094d5c25600fa4b86a2c891008\n状态：真实代码+测试已提交；完整 runtime suite 仍不得冒充已通过\n\nchanged_variable：运行时 canonical token 集与 parser_version 一致性。\n约束：CANONICAL 必须导出、不得重复、与 registry 完全一致；PARSER_VERSION 必须一致；漂移 fail closed。\n测试：缺 token / 重复 token / parser version 漂移。\n意义：下游应用不能维护第二套 token 真相；不是新 canonical。"},{"id":"run_20260905_1933_generator_contract","type":"text","x":1510,"y":1580,"width":570,"height":470,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜生成器 compiler-registry 契约镜像\n来源：770fafb… + d354f9da…\n解决：把 trigger_registry ↔ compiler fail-closed 契约画入应用层，不误写十元语义。\n修改：repo_preflight_v0.1.js / .test.js。\n新变量：runtime canonical token-set consistency / parser_version consistency。\n验证：缺 token、重复 token、版本漂移明确失败。\n拒绝：应用 token 列表作为新 canonical；测试数量冒充完整 runtime PASS。"},{"id":"x_protected_range_topology_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":1780,"width":560,"height":560,"text":"## x｜protected-range 风险拓扑 / current-window 发散（L4 evidence-locked，may_override_canonical=false）\n来源：36dd5ff544a13e77378a4f8f1a9e54c63fa44dc5 + 6480461b6ac71fbf4fa188ca4d8f2697e9f0f96d\n\nchanged_variable：risk_channel / ingress_path / ingress_topology / current_window。\n母分支：未通过当前 risk-test；已验证 ON 后拓扑改变可 OFF；underlying x 与 protected-range 状态分离；不同 risk channel/path 分账；repair/re-enabled 后须重新现实测试。\nWorld War Z：topology A verified ON → vertical aggregation topology B → breach/OFF。\nThe Purge：boundary ON/armed/re-enabled ≠ stable protected-range ON。\n状态：effective dynamic = 2 controls / 2 works；不自动扩 canonical。"},{"id":"run_20260905_2034_xprotected","type":"text","x":1510,"y":2110,"width":590,"height":560,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜x protected-range topology 动态镜像\n来源：36dd5ff… + 6480461b…\n解决：从静态边界推进为 risk-topology + current-window 动态，并加 re-enabled≠protection restored 护栏。\n新变量：risk_channel / ingress_path / ingress_topology / current_window / boundary_state / tested_protection_state。\n拒绝：underlying management x 仍在就假定保护 ON；broad risk 名称没变就外推旧 PASS。\n下一断点：repair 后 same actor/boundary/risk channel 的真实复测。"},{"id":"xz_nz_false_same_layer_guard_20260905","type":"text","x":900,"y":2420,"width":580,"height":610,"text":"## xz × nz｜伪同层共现护栏（L4 candidate / deferred）\n来源：6103099920cee0c614b5fca8c16bb01ca7725540\n案例：红楼梦 宝玉↔黛玉，第96–98回\n权限：may_override_canonical=false\n\n硬门：same characters + same current window + same broad relation label ≠ same object layer。\nxz 候选测婚配处置路径/结果空间收窄；nz 测对象特异、自由、现实 bilateral reentry/repair。\n组合前必须对齐 actor + object + changed_variable + reality_anchor。\nremoval/reverse 表明两端可独立变化。\n状态：strict_xz_nz=false；deferred guard，不增加 evidence-locked control/work。"},{"id":"run_20260905_2232_water_guard","type":"text","x":1510,"y":2730,"width":600,"height":560,"text":"### 2026-09-05｜xz×nz 伪同层共现护栏镜像\n来源：67198a3… 状态纠偏 + 610309992… 宝黛 false-same-layer guard。\n新变量：object_layer / changed_variable / reality_anchor / current-window cooccurrence validity。\n拒绝：same characters + same window + broad relation label 直接视为同层共现。\n验证：nearest-neighbor、removal、reverse 均显示可独立变化。\n下一断点：真正 same actor + same window + same object + same changed_variable 的 xz+nz。"},{"id":"x_strict_precondition_guard_20260906","type":"text","x":380,"y":3090,"width":620,"height":610,"text":"## x｜strict-v2 归因 / 前置条件护栏（L4 pending-review ledger mirror）\n来源：d5b4a4bee27df23f494691e1008f8ace5513ee1f\n权限：may_override_canonical=false\n\nchanged_variable：subject-specific x attribution / stable effect / independent purpose-anchor。\n护栏：保护结果成功 ≠ 主体 stable protected-range x；ordinary self-agency ≠ x；一次现实 effect ≠ stable x；true zn + true x + sole final gate 仍不自动 strict，若 x 有独立用途/排序 anchor 则 zn→x 可失败。\n检查：结果由谁的 path-set 造成；移除第三方后 x 是否仍成立；object 是否外部独立；effect 是否持续；移除 zn 后 x 是否有独立用途。"},{"id":"run_20260906_0033_xstrictguard","type":"text","x":1510,"y":3360,"width":620,"height":570,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜x strict-v2 归因护栏镜像\n来源：d5b4a4bee27df23f494691e1008f8ace5513ee1f\n解决：把 strict-v2 ledger 状态纠偏转译为 x 发散/验证负向护栏，不冒充 canonical。\n新变量：subject-specific attribution / endpoint ownership / stable effect / independent purpose-anchor。\n修正：Hotel Rwanda 结果≠Paul protected-range x；Thomas More ordinary self-agency≠x；Matt King competing-purpose anchor；Antigone 一次 effect≠stable x。\n下一断点：其它单十元可执行母分支。"},{"id":"generator_resolved_request_stability_20260906","type":"text","x":1040,"y":1280,"width":480,"height":430,"text":"## 应用层｜resolved_request 模块 provenance 稳定化\n来源：d8e1e3e43a6cb94bd00cf3513f4c7be7a75666c8 + b72be3da7ec768459aab21f795059ec931d501f6\n状态：真实代码+测试已提交；不等于完整 runtime suite PASS\n\nchanged_variable：locked_modules / reroll_modules 的规范化与复现性。\n\n新增执行约束：\n- module 名称 NFKC + trim\n- 去空项、去重复\n- 按 ALL_MODULES 固定顺序排序\n- 未知模块排在已知模块之后并稳定排序\n- 不修改调用方原数组\n- 语义等价的模块集合应得到一致 resolved_request\n\n专项：测试明确使用 x并z少女，要求 canonical_symbols=['x并z']，因此 provenance 稳定化不得破坏 x并z 原子性。\n\n意义：同 seed/version/subject 下，不再因 locked/reroll 数组输入顺序或重复项制造伪差异；这是应用端可复现性硬门，不是十元语义。"},{"id":"run_20260906_0130_generator_provenance","type":"text","x":1510,"y":3990,"width":620,"height":560,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜生成器 resolved_request provenance 镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：d5b4a4bee… → b72be3da…（中间 13496c4 为上轮 Canvas 自身提交）\n\n真正解决的问题：把生成器 P0-3 的模块 provenance 稳定化镜像到应用执行层/验证层，避免把语义等价请求误当成不同发散输入。\n\n来源提交：\n- d8e1e3e43a6cb94bd00cf3513f4c7be7a75666c8：新增 normalizeModuleList，并接入 locked_modules / reroll_modules\n- b72be3da7ec768459aab21f795059ec931d501f6：新增 5 个 resolved_request stability cases\n\n实际修改源文件：\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/trigger_compiler_v0.1.js\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/resolved_request_stability_v0.1.test.js\n\n新变量：module-list normalization / dedupe / canonical order / request reproducibility / input immutability。\n新增分支：应用端 resolved_request provenance stability。\n验证：5 个针对性测试覆盖 locked 顺序、reroll 去重、NFKC+trim、等价请求 deepEqual、调用方数组不变；x并z 专项保持原子 token。\n拒绝：把这些测试冒充完整 P0 runtime PASS；把应用 provenance 规则写成十元 canonical。\n\n下一断点：优先镜像新的单十元可执行语法；应用端只继续镜像会直接影响发散输入等价性、锁定/重抽稳定性、可复现性的真实变化。"},{"id":"xz_nz_same_layer_false_convergence_20260906","type":"text","x":900,"y":3090,"width":650,"height":650,"text":"## xz × nz｜same-layer 但 xz 独立门失败：二极化 ≠ 单终点汇流\n来源：1988476a29ee576e81ba1f7acba51de92bd254be\n案例：《水浒传》宋江招安，第75–82回\n权限：L4 evidence-locked；may_override_canonical=false\n\n对齐结果：same actor = TRUE；same current window = TRUE；same object = TRUE；same object layer = TRUE；same changed_variable = TRUE。\n被测变量：宋江/梁山相对于朝廷秩序的现实未来处置与重新进入路径集合。\n\nnz：TRUE。招安失败、征讨升级后，归顺/赦免通道仍被宋江现实反复调用，朝廷侧现实回应，最终重新进入朝廷秩序。\nxz：FALSE。至少仍有“继续征讨/军事冲突”与“重新招安/归顺”两个性质不同且现实的端点；招安接口会失败后重开，路径集合重排而非单调汇流。\n\n新增护栏：option count reduction / two-terminal polarization / war escalation / final-outcome hindsight ≠ current xz。必须验证一个前置终点持续取得支配地位，并让不同现实路径持续汇向该终点。\n意义：same-layer gate 通过只是组合前置条件，不是 xz+nz 自动共现。"},{"id":"run_20260906_0233_water_same_layer_guard","type":"text","x":1510,"y":4610,"width":680,"height":650,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜宋江招安 same-layer false-convergence 护栏镜像\n检查范围：b72be3da7… → e025574a7…\n真正新增研究：1988476a29ee576e81ba1f7acba51de92bd254be。其余 d9170a0… / e25360e8… / e025574a… 主要把既有 World War Z protected-range topology dynamic 同步到 2/2，不重复建机制节点。\n\n实际修改源文件：07-Codex大脑库/待审议问题_xz-nz_水浒传宋江招安二极化不等于xz且回返通道仍可现实重开护栏_20260906.md\n\n本轮解决：把“伪同层”之后的下一道门补出来。即便 actor/window/object/changed_variable 全部同层，也必须让 xz 与 nz 分别独立过门。\n新变量：terminal structure / path monotonicity / path reopening / endpoint dominance / reentry persistence。\n新增：xz 的 false-convergence guard；nz 的 political/legal reentry 可迁移子型。\n验证：终点前置不足；路径持续收窄失败；路径汇流失败；最终结果不得后验制造 xz。\n拒绝：把战争升级、选项变少、最后归顺直接标 xz；把 L4 evidence-locked 边界护栏升级 canonical。\n下一断点：寻找真正 same-layer 且 xz=true + nz=true 的严格共现，或继续补 zx/nx/zn/n/xn/z/x并z 的完整母变换动作。"},{"id":"zn_x_strict_cross_mechanism_20260906","type":"text","x":1040,"y":3760,"width":680,"height":650,"text":"## zn × x｜strict-v2 第二份跨机制正例：industrial x 被 zn 重定向\n来源：971124cb0733276f0e147d82708f18172f3f7e03\n案例：《辛德勒的名单》Brünnlitz 工厂保护阶段（1944秋→1945解放）\n权限：L4 evidence-locked；may_override_canonical=false\n\n独立过门：zn=true；x=true。x 只锁 Schindler 对 Brünnlitz factory organization 的 current management / employment-use / resource-allocation boundary，明确排除 SS 暴力主权、transfer list 单方终裁等外部权力。\n\nchanged_variable：pre-existing industrial/employment organization 的用途排序与现实保护落点。\nzn→x：在窄 current window 内，普通商业获利/军工生产已不足以解释迁厂、特定囚犯雇佣、亏损投入、低产出与假生产数据；拿掉救人 zn，当前 x 的使用方向出现缺口。\nx→zn：拿掉 subject-specific Brünnlitz organizational x，救人原则仍在，但同层 employment/placement/resource protection reality-anchor 消失。\n\nnearest-neighbor：不同于 Defiance 的 community admission/governance，本案是 pre-existing industrial x 被 zn 重新定向成保护组织。\n护栏：早期 Emalia 获利阶段不能一锅煮成 strict；German/SS approval、Stern/Pemper、Emilie 等第三因素冻结但不抹除。\n状态：strict-v2 verified-positive；effective strict-v2 2 controls / 2 works；x-scope/protected-range increment=0；不升级 canonical。"},{"id":"run_20260906_0432_znx_schindler","type":"text","x":1510,"y":5320,"width":700,"height":680,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜zn×x strict-v2 跨机制正例镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：ca6ffe8d73a7020ae4c11e0c2435f136b6ea3203 → 971124cb0733276f0e147d82708f18172f3f7e03\n\n本轮真正解决：把辛德勒 Brünnlitz 阶段的 strict-v2 复验转译为可迁移的组合机制，而不是再堆一个作品 mapping。\n来源 commit：971124cb0733276f0e147d82708f18172f3f7e03\n实际修改源文件：07-Codex大脑库/运行记录_zn-x-strict-v2第二份跨机制正例_辛德勒_Brunnlitz工厂保护边界_20260906.md\n\n新变量：industrial-x purpose redirection / current-window narrowing / employment-use boundary / resource-allocation anchor / third-factor freeze / competing-anchor freeze。\n新增分支：zn 使 pre-existing industrial x 在窄窗口中改变用途排序，并由 x 为 zn 提供 subject-specific reality anchor。\n验证：zn 与 x 分别独立过门；same current window + same object layer；zn→x=true；x→zn=true；third-factor freeze PASS；competing-anchor freeze PASS。\n拒绝：把 transfer-list 单方终裁、SS/camp sovereign authority 倒灌成 Schindler x；把早期商业获利阶段与 Brünnlitz rescue window 混为一体；把 L4 evidence-locked 结果升级 canonical。\n\n下一断点：继续寻找第三种不同 x topology 的 strict zn↔x 正例，或优先补 zx/nx/zn/n/xn/z/x并z 的单十元母变换动作。"},{"id":"xz_return_path_decrement_guard_20260906","type":"text","x":300,"y":3780,"width":650,"height":600,"text":"## xz｜same-variable 单接口减少 ≠ current xz（L4 evidence-locked guard）\n来源：37ffd41529a65d415c1d809ad1ca10f410d114fc\n案例：《西游记》第二次逐出，第56–58回\n权限：may_override_canonical=false\n\n对齐已全部通过：same actors / same current window / same object / same object layer / same changed_variable。\nchanged_variable：relevant return_path_set 的可调用接口数量与拓扑。\n现实变化：direct + mediated → direct CLOSED + mediated OPEN，即 local_path_decrement=true。\n\n结论：路径真实 2→1 仍不足以构成 current xz，因为 surviving mediated path 仍现实存在、被调用，并最终完成 reentry；complete relevant return-path set 没有归零。\n\n发散语法护栏：局部 decrement 先问“完整路径集还剩什么”，不能把单接口关闭当作 trajectory closure。升级 xz 仍需终点前置、跨阶段持续收窄、不同路径向同一终点汇流、临界逼近。\n可继续长树：n>1→1→0；接口关闭顺序；surviving path 是否重开/旁路；target-effect reality-test 是否同步 OFF。"},{"id":"generator_subject_joiner_normalization_20260906","type":"text","x":1040,"y":4490,"width":620,"height":440,"text":"## 应用层｜重复主体连接词 normalization\n来源：1ab7a03916ec462ee5d3fe2b54fcc2f9b0175d1a + 10f91edfac7c7beff9869130a617b9ac2962bf82\n状态：真实代码+专项测试已提交；不等于完整 P0 runtime PASS\n\nchanged_variable：trigger 与 subject 的边界规范化。\n实现：subject 前导连续“的”由只剥一枚改为 /^的+/ 全部剥离。\n边界：zn的的少女 → zn + 少女；x ＋ z 的 的 少女 → x,z + 少女；x并z的的 → ERROR_EMPTY_SUBJECT；Ｘ并Ｚ的的少女 → ['x并z'] + 少女。\n\n验证意义：表面连接词重复不应制造不同 subject；同时不得影响 canonical_symbols，尤其 x并z 原子性必须保持。\n拒绝：把 parser convenience 反写成十元语义；把 4 个专项 case 冒充完整 suite PASS。"},{"id":"run_20260906_0932_backlog_mirror","type":"text","x":1510,"y":6060,"width":720,"height":760,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜xz 单接口 decrement + 生成器 subject joiner backlog 镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：971124cb0733276f0e147d82708f18172f3f7e03 → 8fe2a6ff534fab059f42cc205fc255adda0ced80\n\n真正解决的问题：补回此前因 Canvas 完整 blob 读取受阻而未写入的两项真实信息增益；本轮已通过 fetch_blob 取得完整 JSON 后再合并。\n来源：37ffd415… xz same-variable local decrement guard；1ab7a039… + 10f91edf… generator repeated subject joiner normalization/test。\n实际修改源文件：\n- 07-Codex大脑库/待审议问题_xz-nz_西游记同一回返路径集合减少一个接口不等于current-xz护栏_20260906.md\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/trigger_compiler_v0.1.js\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/trigger_compiler_subject_joiner_v0.1.test.js\n\n新变量：complete relevant return_path_set / local interface decrement / surviving path reality / subject-boundary normalization / canonical-token preservation。\n新增分支：xz 的 same-variable decrement negative guard；应用端 subject joiner normalization。\n验证：xz 终点前置不足、持续收窄不足、汇流不足、临界逼近不足；surviving mediated path 被现实调用并完成回返。generator 专项保持 x并z 原子、空主体仍硬失败。\n拒绝：2→1 直接判 xz；把状态同步 400f50d6… / 082174d… / b0a1432… / 02f018e… / 8fe2a6f… 重复造机制节点；把应用 parser 规则升级 canonical。\n下一断点：优先寻找 complete path-set 的 n>1→1→0 + alternate-path convergence / target-effect OFF 样本；同时继续补 zx/nx/zn/n/xn/z/x并z 的单十元母变换动作。"},{"id":"xz_complete_path_audit_guard_20260906","type":"text","x":300,"y":4450,"width":690,"height":650,"text":"## xz｜chosen path 到 0 ≠ complete relevant path-set 到 0（L4 evidence-locked guard）\n来源：1ff6d6439c49961f8e3032a372b8b48a55c628f2\n案例：《三国演义》关羽麦城，第77回\n权限：candidate / evidence-locked；may_override_canonical=false\n\nchanged_variable：complete relevant escape-path set 的可调用路径数量与拓扑。\n文本明确枚举大路/小路；关羽主动选择小路，小路经连续伏兵最终走到 0，但大路没有在同一窗口被实证关闭、汇回同一捕获链或证明为 nominal-only。\n\n锁定护栏：actual chosen path exhausted = TRUE，不等于 complete relevant path set exhausted。未采用接口不能因最终结局发生而事后回填为“当时已经关闭”。\n审计必须分账：enumerated interfaces / actually chosen path / externally closed paths / nominal-only paths / untested paths。\nnearest-neighbor：zx 可解释主动选路；z 可解释一次裁定；xn 可解释伏兵流程；x 可解释局部擒拿，都不能补写未测试大路状态。\n结论：麦城 current xz 仍可由其它证据支持，但不能承担 complete n>1→1→0 的强证明。"},{"id":"x_path_set_exhaustion_positive_20260906","type":"text","x":1040,"y":5000,"width":720,"height":720,"text":"## x｜首份真实 path-set exhaustion 正例：same-family 3→1→0（L4 evidence-locked）\n来源：6c7927c61e7e7825276944a5e730f7ac8ae9f110\n案例：Apollo 13 / Service Module fuel-cell electrical generation\n权限：may_override_canonical=false；strict-v2/protected-range 不增量\n\nchanged_variable：actor-indexed same-object actuator/effect family 的 surviving relevant path count。\n对象层锁定为 CSM/SM fuel-cell generation，不偷换成“整艘飞船还有没有任何电”。\nP={fuel cell 1,2,3}：事故后 cells 1/3 OFF → cell 2 单独承担剩余 load → 氧气继续流失后三者全部 OFF，真实 3→1→0；同层 target effect 同时 OFF。\n\n正向发散语法：same actor + same object layer + same actuator/effect family + same current window → completeness audit → surviving path n>1→1→0 → tested-layer target effect OFF。\n必冻替代项：direct repair / bypass / delegated route / emergency interface / alternate execution node / third-party node。CM batteries 与 LM power 属跨 actuator/object substitute，只说明高层“仍有电”，不得倒灌成原 fuel-cell path 仍存活。\n意义：窄层 complete path=0 可以与高层 capability 继续成立并存；这是 path-set exhaustion 独立 verified 子槽 1 control / 1 work，不自动扩 canonical。\n下一验证：首份普通正例缺口已退役；转向 false-exhaustion adversarial negative，检查被漏枚举的 recoverable/repair/bypass/emergency route。"},{"id":"run_20260906_1034_pathset_exhaustion","type":"text","x":1510,"y":6900,"width":760,"height":780,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜complete path-set exhaustion 正反边界镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：3a8a2d3582eaed823890456db73cb394b11ea845 → 6c7927c61e7e7825276944a5e730f7ac8ae9f110\n本轮真正解决：把“路径走到 0”拆成 chosen trajectory 与 complete relevant path-set 两个变量，并首次镜像一份经过 completeness audit 的真实 3→1→0 positive。\n\n来源提交：\n- 1ff6d6439c49961f8e3032a372b8b48a55c628f2：关羽麦城 complete-path exhaustion 过强推断修正\n- 6c7927c61e7e7825276944a5e730f7ac8ae9f110：Apollo 13 fuel-cell same-family path-set exhaustion positive\n实际修改源文件：\n- 07-Codex大脑库/待审议问题_xz-nz_三国演义关羽麦城大路未冻结导致complete-path-exhaustion不足修正_20260906.md\n- 07-Codex大脑库/运行记录_zn-x-xscope首份真实path-set-exhaustion_Apollo13_SM三燃料电池3到1到0但CM电池与LM电源仅属跨actuator对象替代_20260906.md\n\n新变量：chosen-path vs complete-path-set / enumerated-but-untested interface / actor-indexed actuator family / path completeness / tested-layer effect OFF / cross-layer substitute。\n新增：xz complete-path audit negative guard；x path-set exhaustion positive grammar。\n验证：nearest-neighbor、removal、reverse、third-factor freeze；关羽样本拒绝后验关闭大路，Apollo 正例冻结 CM batteries/LM/Mission Control 等跨层替代。\n拒绝：actual path=0 直接写 complete path=0；高层 capability 仍存活就否定窄层 path=0；把 L4 evidence 自动升级 canonical。\n下一断点：优先寻找 Apollo 型假 path=0 的 adversarial negative；同时继续补 zx/nx/zn/n/xn/z/x并z 的单十元母变换动作。"},{"id":"generator_malformed_connector_guard_20260906","type":"text","x":1040,"y":5800,"width":650,"height":480,"text":"## 应用层｜malformed explicit-multi connector fail-closed\n来源：b6299109d3012b22abd0ed55ec394a43aa9933bc + 6981fbd85db7789d256590cc6f8e5d08d90b3352\n状态：真实代码+专项测试已提交；不等于完整 P0 runtime PASS\n\nchanged_variable：显式 multi connector 后继 token 的合法性。\n规则：消费 + / ＋ 后，下一个内容必须以合法 canonical token 开始，否则 ERROR_UNKNOWN_TOKEN，并标 after_connector=true。\n拒绝：zx++zn少女、zx＋＋zn少女、zx+的少女、zx+zn+少女。\n保持：zx+zn的少女、x并z+zx少女；x并z 仍为原子 token。\n意义：malformed connector 不得被静默吞成 subject，也不得反写十元语义。"},{"id":"xz_xiapi_complete_path_positive_20260906","type":"text","x":300,"y":5200,"width":730,"height":760,"text":"## xz｜完整 relevant path-set 逐步耗尽 pure xz 正控（L4 evidence-locked）\n来源：c83b28d64da681f4acbe6b82a8ce2989e31bc609\n案例：《三国演义》吕布下邳，第19回\n权限：may_override_canonical=false；current_xz=true；nz not_tested\n\nchanged_variable：吕布维持下邳控制并避免被擒的 relevant path-set 数量、可调用性与通达性。\n对象层：siege-level survival/escape/control-retention path set。\n\n路径生命周期：主动出击/掎角/断粮（曾可行但 subject-side abandonment）→ 坚守下邳逐步退化 → 袁术外援被条件化为先送女 → 护女突围实际执行后失败 → 水攻进一步压缩城防/出口 → 最后内部东门/守城控制被倒戈切断 → 被擒。\n\n为什么通过：终点前置 PASS；方向被未来规定 PASS；路径持续收窄 PASS；守/求援/突围/城防控制等不同现实路线发生汇流；临界逼近直到 complete relevant path-set=0。\n护栏：subject-side abandonment 本身不能冒充环境关闭；被擒后的求生处分属于下一对象层，禁止混算。\n意义：这是 xz 纵向语法从“2→1 仍不足”向“多类现实接口被同一前置终点逐步压到 0”推进的正向 control。"},{"id":"x_false_exhaustion_tmi_guard_20260906","type":"text","x":1040,"y":6360,"width":760,"height":760,"text":"## x｜false path-set exhaustion 最近邻反例：effect OFF ≠ path=0（L4 evidence-locked）\n来源：0b577f5e6fa5b857d712f9896a26acbc951f54fb\n案例：Three Mile Island Unit 2 / auxiliary feedwater\n权限：may_override_canonical=false；zn not_locked；strict-v2/protected-range 不增量\n\nchanged_variable：same-actor same-object/effect-family 下 path_state 与真实 surviving recoverable path count。\n事实结构：AFW pumps 已运行并建立压力，但 discharge/isolation valves 关闭，所以 flow=0；约 8 分钟操作员打开阀门后，同一 AFW system 恢复 flow。\n\n因此：effect OFF ≠ path exhausted。closed isolation + same-actor reopen ability still effective = blocked/isolated/recoverable path retained。\npath_state 应分 active / blocked / isolated / recoverable / revoked / destroyed / exhausted。\n\n只有 active=0，且 blocked/isolated 无现实解除方式、recoverable=0，并完成 direct repair / bypass / delegated route / parallel authority / emergency interface / alternate node 审计，且 tested-layer target effect OFF，才允许 verified path-set exhaustion=true。\nnearest-neighbor：Apollo 13 是 true 3→1→0；TMI-2 的最小差异是 same-layer reopen command 仍有效并现实恢复 target effect。\nremoval：拿掉 reopen ability 才更接近真归零；reverse：保留 reopen ability + flow=0 仍不能反推 path=0。"},{"id":"run_20260906_1431_pathset_controls","type":"text","x":1510,"y":7780,"width":800,"height":900,"text":"### 2026-09-06｜complete-path xz 正控 + false-exhaustion 反例 + generator connector 镜像\n任务：十元发散引擎 Canvas 扩散\n检查范围：6c7927c61e7e7825276944a5e730f7ac8ae9f110 → 01c9a0bbd295f31a0918e1cdee24fadda4595033（10 commits）\n\n本轮真正解决：把 Apollo 后续的正向 xz complete-path control 与 x path-set adversarial negative 一起镜像，形成 positive→nearest-negative 的可执行验证链；同时补入生成器 malformed connector fail-closed。\n来源提交：c83b28d… 吕布下邳 pure xz complete-path 正控；0b577f5e… TMI-2 false-exhaustion guard；b6299109… + 6981fbd8… generator connector guard/test。e93a3fc3… 与 aa634825… / 4fa81bab… / e527c4ad… / 01c9a0bb… 为 Apollo gap/registry/ledger/overview 同步，原位吸收，不重复造机制节点。\n\n实际修改源文件：\n- 07-Codex大脑库/待审议问题_xz-nz_三国演义吕布下邳完整逃脱路径逐步耗尽pure-xz正控_20260906.md\n- 07-Codex大脑库/运行记录_zn-x-xscope假path-set-exhaustion反例_ThreeMileIsland_TMI2辅助给水泵已运行但关闭阀门阻断流量且同一操作员仍可开阀恢复故effect-off不等于path-exhausted_20260906.md\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/trigger_compiler_v0.1.js\n- 09-给674（我）用的库/09-方法论与工作流/五行轴角色生成器/实现/trigger_compiler_connector_guard_v0.1.test.js\n\n新变量：complete relevant path-set lifecycle / subject abandonment vs external closure / pre-existing endpoint convergence / path_state / recoverable route / malformed connector successor validity。\n新增/修正：xz complete-path positive control；x false-exhaustion adversarial guard；Apollo 首份普通正例缺口退役并转 false-exhaustion 验证；应用端 connector fail-closed。\n验证：Xiapi current-xz 五门通过；TMI nearest-neighbor/removal/reverse 击穿 effect-OFF→path=0；x并z 在 generator multi 中继续保持原子。\n拒绝：主体没选的路径自动算关闭；flow=0 自动算 path=0；状态同步重复造节点；应用 parser 规则升级 canonical。\n下一断点：优先把 xz 正控抽象成 endpoint-dominance + path-lifecycle 的更一般母变换，并继续找可击穿该正控的 complete-path adversarial negative；长期优先补 zx/nx/zn/n/xn/z/x并z 的单十元母变换动作。"}],"edges":[{"id":"e_input_lock","fromNode":"input","toNode":"lock_problem","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_lock_var","fromNode":"lock_problem","toNode":"find_variable","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_var_core","fromNode":"find_variable","toNode":"core","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_core_single","fromNode":"core","toNode":"single_deep","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_core_horizontal","fromNode":"core","toNode":"horizontal","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_single_combine","fromNode":"single_deep","toNode":"combine","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_horizontal_combine","fromNode":"horizontal","toNode":"combine","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_combine_verify","fromNode":"combine","toNode":"verify","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_verify_output","fromNode":"verify","toNode":"outputs","fromSide":"right","toSide":"left"},{"id":"e_rule_core","fromNode":"rule","toNode":"core","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_zx","fromNode":"core","toNode":"zx","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_nx","fromNode":"core","toNode":"nx","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_zn","fromNode":"core","toNode":"zn","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_z","fromNode":"core","toNode":"z","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_n","fromNode":"core","toNode":"n","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xpz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"x_parallel_z","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xn","fromNode":"core","toNode":"xn","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_x","fromNode":"core","toNode":"x","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_xz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"xz","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_core_nz","fromNode":"core","toNode":"nz","fromSide":"bottom","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e_protocol_runlog","fromNode":"automation_protocol","toNode":"r